ll-town clutter belongs in the frame: taped paper notices, a leaning bin, a bent drainpipe, scuffed kerbs, weeds through the pavement, a dusty parked Lada. Signs may clip a little but the overall image stays natural — never glowing, never hyper-saturated, no HDR look, no rim-light effects, no lens flare, no arrows, no circles, no cracks, no sparks, no graphic overlays of any kind. The board carries Cyrillic lettering as visual texture, small and partly out of focus; exact legibility is not required. 16:9. No title overlay text, no captions, no subtitle bars, no large lettering across the frame, no watermark, no logo."
