lt, honest texture on skin, steel, mud and wet cloth. Ordinary field clutter belongs in the frame: ration boxes, jerrycans, a coil of cable, a bent road sign, puddles holding flat reflections. The image stays natural — never glowing, never hyper-saturated, no HDR look, no rim-light effects, no lens flare, no arrows, no circles, no cracks, no sparks, no graphic overlays of any kind. Any lettering stays small and partly out of focus; exact legibility is not required. 16:9. No title overlay text, no captions, no subtitle bars, no large lettering across the frame, no watermark, no logo."
